flowchart TD
    W([Client writes data]) --> P[Primary database commits the write]
    P --> T["Primary returns a RYW token (timestamp or replication sequence number)"]
    T --> R([Client issues a later read carrying the token])
    R --> Q{Replica state caught up to the token?}
    Q -->|Yes| S1[Serve the read from the replica]
    Q -->|No| S2[Route the read to the primary or a sufficiently updated replica]
